      "description": {
        "fun": "The little turtle behind the Terastal phenomenon. It was thought to have died out in seismic shifts some two million years ago, but it survived by crystallising its body and hibernating deep under Area Zero, and its crystals gave Area Zero its glittering look. In battle it shifts into a shaggy Terastal Form, and its name blends Terastal, terrapin and Galápagos.",
